Protenix (github.com/bytedance/Protenix, 2475421) changes for the CUDA-graph fine-tune harness:
- the fast LayerNorm extension launches on the current stream (it used the legacy default stream, so a graph capture missed
  its kernels and replays read stale values);
- the confidence head takes a precomputed representative-atom index when the feature dict has one (a boolean mask index
  synchronises with the host, which a capture cannot).
Apply with `git apply protenix.patch` in the Protenix checkout; rebuild the LayerNorm extension (delete its build directory).

